<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Inventory - Tor-AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .inv-container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .inv-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 30px; }
        .inv-card { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .inv-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .inv-qty { background: var(--primary); color: #000; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        
        .multiplier-section { background: rgba(241, 196, 15, 0.05); border: 1px solid #f1c40f; border-radius: 15px; padding: 25px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .mult-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; margin-top: 15px; }
        .mult-badge { background: #f1c40f; color: #000; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
        
        .empty-state { text-align: center; padding: 50px; color: var(--text-dim); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="inv-container">
        <header style="margin-bottom: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <h1 style="color: var(--primary); margin:0;"><i class="fas fa-box-open"></i> MY INVENTORY</h1>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="logout-link" style="text-decoration: none;">대시보드로 돌아가기</a>
        </header>

        <section class="multiplier-section">
            <h2 style="color: #f1c40f; margin-top:0;"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> 활성화된 점수 배율 (1회성)</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;">럭키 가차로 획득한 배율권입니다. 다음 게임 플레이 후 사라집니다.</p>
            <div class="mult-grid">
                <% let activeMults = 0; %>
                <% if(multipliers.airplane_score_multiplier > 1) { activeMults++; %><div class="mult-badge">Airplane: x<%= multipliers.airplane_score_multiplier %></div><% } %>
                <% if(multipliers.mc_world_score_multiplier > 1) { activeMults++; %><div class="mult-badge">MC World: x<%= multipliers.mc_world_score_multiplier %></div><% } %>
                <% if(multipliers.paper_rush_multiplier > 1) { activeMults++; %><div class="mult-badge">Paper Rush: x<%= multipliers.paper_rush_multiplier %></div><% } %>
                <% if(activeMults === 0) { %>
                    <p style="color: #aaa;">현재 활성화된 배율권이 없습니다. 상점에서 뽑기를 진행해보세요!</p>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </section>

        <h2 style="color: #fff; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary); padding-bottom: 10px;">보유 중인 아이템</h2>
        
        <% if(inventory.length === 0) { %>
            <div class="empty-state">
                <i class="fas fa-ghost" style="font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 20px;"></i>
                <h3>인벤토리가 비어 있습니다.</h3>
                <p>상점에서 아이템을 구매하여 게임에서 유리한 고지를 점하세요!</p>
                <a href="/shop" class="btn" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:20px; background: var(--primary); color:#000; text-decoration:none; padding:10px 25px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:bold;">상점으로 이동</a>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>
            <div class="inv-grid">
                <% inventory.forEach(item => { %>
                    <div class="inv-card">
                        <div class="inv-icon">
                            <% if(item.item_key.includes('hp') || item.item_key.includes('mana')) { %>
                                <i class="fas fa-flask"></i>
                            <% } else if(item.item_key.includes('shield')) { %>
                                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <i class="fas fa-cube"></i>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="margin: 10px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color:#fff;"><%= item.name %></h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 15px;"><%= item.description %></p>
                        <div>
                            <span class="inv-qty">수량: <%= item.quantity %></span>
                        </div>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--primary); margin-top: 15px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;">
                            Game: <%= item.game_type %>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
